</table></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="S6.T3.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:621.0pt;"><span id="S6.T3.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">ACT is evaluated on eight manipulation tasks in simulation environments under different camera configurations.
Seven configurations are compared using different combinations of the front, side, and wrist-mounted cameras (Front, Side, and Hand).
Each value represents the mean success rate (<math id="S6.T3.m65" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> standard deviation) over five random seeds.</span></p></div></div>
</figure>
